KPL/PCK
Regression: finite numbers whose terms overflow. A rotation rate of 1e306 deg/day made W
infinite a few centuries from the epoch (the model was made, myb_wgccre_rotation gave NaN);
a quaternion of components 1e200 had an infinite norm (the identity was returned).
